00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:13.170
An API is many things.

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:15.090
But it's specifically
something that

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:18.570
helps you use someone
else's services.

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:22.390
You need to tell them what
they can do with your service.

00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:23.370
